mi:Example_cat_8_U6_1_1 a mi:Example ;
  skos:prefLabel "America at Century's End - Compare and contrast the United States in 1800 with the United States in 1898 focusing on similarities and differences in territory, population, systems of transportation, governmental policies promoting economic development, economic change, the treatment of African Americans, and policies toward American Indians." ;
  mi:exampleText "America at Century's End - Compare and contrast the United States in 1800 with the United States in 1898 focusing on similarities and differences in territory, population, systems of transportation, governmental policies promoting economic development, economic change, the treatment of African Americans, and policies toward American Indians." .

